1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,467
Omar: Floor four. Mrs. Lin lives here.

2
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:09,648
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Attention, residents. This is The
Last Floor. Part two of three: the stairs.

3
00:00:10,318 --> 00:00:13,661
Mrs. Lin: Pip! There you are! Who locked
my stairs?

4
00:00:14,331 --> 00:00:15,676
Bell: I did. Rule one.

5
00:00:15,796 --> 00:00:16,359
Mrs. Lin: ...Fair.

6
00:00:17,029 --> 00:00:19,311
Bell: Go up. Seal the door behind you.

7
00:00:19,981 --> 00:00:26,085
Omar: Floor four, five, six... that's a
lot of floors.

8
00:00:26,205 --> 00:00:27,707
Zara: Keep climbing. Don't count.

9
00:00:28,377 --> 00:00:30,041
Zara: Floor five. The stairs are blocked!

10
00:00:30,711 --> 00:00:32,681
Bell: Push! Everyone push!

11
00:00:33,351 --> 00:00:34,188
Zara: ...Direct hit.

12
00:00:34,951 --> 00:00:38,077
Mrs. Lin: That's my sister's flat. She
says never open it.

13
00:00:38,747 --> 00:00:40,754
Mrs. Lin: Dot, you're not well.

14
00:00:41,424 --> 00:00:43,185
Bell: Leave her. Lock the door.

15
00:00:43,855 --> 00:00:45,617
Mrs. Lin: Goodbye, Dot. Click.

16
00:00:46,287 --> 00:00:48,388
Zara: They're gaining. Floor seven.

17
00:00:49,058 --> 00:00:52,036
Omar: Twelve floors. My legs filed a
complaint.

18
00:00:52,706 --> 00:00:54,951
Bell: Shortcut! Through the floor ten
hall!

19
00:00:55,621 --> 00:01:02,252
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part two of three, The
Last Floor. Next: the roof. Follow for part three.

